  "abilities": [],
  "behavior": "It swims randomly around the areas it inhabits. If it detects a threat, it will try to approach and attack, although its low speed greatly limits its ability to chase targets.",
  "interactionWithPlayer": "It is hostile toward the player, but on its own it is not a significant threat.",
  "interactionWithCreatures": "It is prey for Diving Bell Spiders and other aquatic creatures. It will try to defend itself when attacked, but its low strength means it will usually lose the fight.",
  "strategy": "A spear with a Salty or Spicy infusion is a good option against this enemy. Salty damage turns its meat into jerky, while Spicy damage cooks it. In general, fighting Water Fleas is rarely worth it and you can usually just move past them.",
